    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "branch-create-command",
        "moduleId": "create-branch-pointer",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "procedure",
        "title": "创建分支的命令与输出",
        "markdown": "在 `master` 分支上为曲线拟合实验创建分支，命令是：\n\n```bash\n$ git branch fit\n```\n\n这条命令只创建名为 `fit` 的新分支，不会改变当前所在的分支。再次运行 `git branch` 可以看到：\n\n```text\n* master\n  fit\n```\n\n星号 `*` 标记当前分支，说明我们仍然留在 `master` 上。教材用一个类比解释这一点：新建一个目录并不会自动把我们移入该目录。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-dacd3293b5aedfe0e5a195bd",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000029"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "Going Further with Git",
                "Creating a Branch"
              ],
              "lineStart": 2789,
              "lineEnd": 2860,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "7898da87bacf07232146ff8bc7a10f695d23ace3950165162fa9d388a70daba9"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "branch-is-a-pointer",
        "moduleId": "create-branch-pointer",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "补充理解：分支是一个指针",
        "markdown": "把分支理解成一个指向某次提交的可移动指针，就很容易解释上面的现象：`git branch fit` 只是新增了一个指针，让它和 `master` 指向同一个提交，而 `HEAD`（当前所在位置的标记）没有移动。因此「创建分支」和「进入分支」是两件事，必须分别执行。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "branch-create-command"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "branch-verify-status",
        "moduleId": "verify-branch-state",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "用 git status 交叉确认",
        "markdown": "除了 `git branch`，还可以用 `git status` 确认当前状态：\n\n```text\n$ git status\nOn branch master\nnothing to commit, working directory clean\n```\n\n输出明确写着 `On branch master`，与星号的位置一致。两条检查互相印证，说明新分支已经存在，但当前工作仍在 `master` 上。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-dacd3293b5aedfe0e5a195bd",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000029"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "Going Further with Git",
                "Creating a Branch"
              ],
              "lineStart": 2789,
              "lineEnd": 2860,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "7898da87bacf07232146ff8bc7a10f695d23ace3950165162fa9d388a70daba9"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "branch-check-worked-example",
        "moduleId": "verify-branch-state",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "worked-example",
        "title": "补充示例：从创建到确认的完整核对",
        "markdown": "把创建到确认的完整过程连起来看：\n\n1. 执行 `git branch fit`：创建分支，不切换。\n2. 执行 `git branch`：输出中 `*` 仍在 `master`。\n3. 执行 `git status`：显示 `On branch master`。\n\n只要第 2、3 步任意一处显示的不是预期的分支名，就说明还没切换成功，此时继续提交会把改动记到错误的分支上。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "branch-create-command",
            "branch-verify-status"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "branch-switch-command",
        "moduleId": "switch-workspace",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "procedure",
        "title": "切换到新分支",
        "markdown": "切换到新分支使用 `checkout` 命令，这与前面命令行章节中见过的 `git checkout` 是同一个命令：\n\n```bash\n$ git checkout fit\n$ git branch\n  master\n* fit\n```\n\n此时星号移到了 `fit`，表示当前分支已经切换。刚切换时还没有做任何改动，所以 `master` 和 `fit` 指向仓库历史中的同一个位置，`ls` 和 `git log` 看到的文件和提交历史都不会变化。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
